1
00:00:18,144 --> 00:00:19,644
Hey, part-timer!

2
00:00:19,644 --> 00:00:21,104
Take care of the front.

3
00:00:21,104 --> 00:00:22,564
Okay!

4
00:00:23,734 --> 00:00:25,444
Stop saying that.

5
00:00:25,984 --> 00:00:27,494
You said it would be

6
00:00:27,494 --> 00:00:30,154
be more efficient if we took breaks...

7
00:00:30,534 --> 00:00:32,244
Well, you're the one who needs to rest

8
00:00:32,244 --> 00:00:33,704
every few steps.

9
00:00:33,704 --> 00:00:36,124
We need to hide from Organization pursuit.

10
00:00:36,124 --> 00:00:37,754
No one's chasing us.

11
00:00:37,754 --> 00:00:39,414
Okabe Rintarou!

12
00:00:40,124 --> 00:00:41,044
What's this?

13
00:00:42,004 --> 00:00:42,924
You want to know?

14
00:00:43,254 --> 00:00:45,674
Normally, it would be top-secret,

15
00:00:45,674 --> 00:00:48,674
and I wouldn't be able to just tell you.

16
00:00:48,674 --> 00:00:51,344
If you're going to take a while, then put it down!

17
00:00:51,344 --> 00:00:52,594
Endure, assistant.

18
00:00:52,594 --> 00:00:55,644
Then stop making it into a big deal, and just tell her!

19
00:00:55,644 --> 00:00:57,144
Don't be stupid.

20
00:00:57,144 --> 00:00:58,894
This item is of the utmost importance.

21
00:00:58,894 --> 00:01:00,394
If we don't make a big deal out of it here,

22
00:01:00,394 --> 00:01:02,024
then where should we make a big deal out of it?

23
00:01:02,024 --> 00:01:03,984
Is it an IBN 5100?

24
00:01:04,864 --> 00:01:06,774
She found out, Christina!

25
00:01:06,774 --> 00:01:08,614
Where'd you find one?

26
00:01:08,614 --> 00:01:10,994
It was kept in Yanabayashi Shrine,

27
00:01:10,994 --> 00:01:13,994
where I, the mad scientist chosen by God...

28
00:01:13,994 --> 00:01:16,584
I said put it down!

29
00:01:16,584 --> 00:01:18,294
Makise Kurisu...

30
00:01:18,594 --> 00:01:19,834
Y-Yes.

31
00:01:19,834 --> 00:01:21,084
Who is this?

32
00:01:21,964 --> 00:01:25,384
A part-timer at the CRT TV Workshop...

33
00:01:26,634 --> 00:01:27,924
Um...

34
00:01:34,144 --> 00:01:35,974
Hey! Part-timer!

35
00:01:35,974 --> 00:01:37,184
What are you doing, talking on the job?

36
00:01:43,524 --> 00:01:45,234
Why was she glaring at me?

37
00:01:45,234 --> 00:01:47,364
Because you look like a thug.

38
00:02:10,154 --> 00:02:15,824
Even the number of several billion heartbeats

