427
00:03:43,344 --> 00:03:45,524
The sight warms my heart!

428
00:03:45,524 --> 00:03:47,474
Okay, let it down slowly.

429
00:03:47,844 --> 00:03:49,194
I know.

430
00:03:48,394 --> 00:03:49,194
Kurisu-chan!

431
00:03:50,904 --> 00:03:54,034
Sorry to come by so suddenly again.

432
00:03:55,034 --> 00:03:57,034
You can come whenever you want.

433
00:03:57,034 --> 00:03:58,784
You're a lab member.

434
00:03:58,784 --> 00:04:01,664
Yesterday, she was saying she'd never come back.

435
00:04:01,824 --> 00:04:03,584
You change your mind quite easily, don't you?

436
00:04:03,584 --> 00:04:05,914
I'm not here because I want to be!

437
00:04:05,914 --> 00:04:07,794
You asked me for help.

438
00:04:09,044 --> 00:04:11,214
So you don't want to come here?

439
00:04:11,214 --> 00:04:14,554
No, that isn't it. 
It's not that I don't like this place...

440
00:04:14,554 --> 00:04:16,054
So what's in the box?

441
00:04:17,264 --> 00:04:18,344
You want to know?

442
00:04:18,724 --> 00:04:19,884
Normally, it would be...

443
00:04:19,884 --> 00:04:21,594
An IBN 5100.

444
00:04:21,594 --> 00:04:23,684
Seriously? Wow!

445
00:04:23,684 --> 00:04:25,184
Way to go, Okarin!

446
00:04:25,184 --> 00:04:27,894
He does all the things an Okarin can!

447
00:04:27,894 --> 00:04:28,984
And that's why we love himâ

448
00:04:28,984 --> 00:04:31,154
I don't admire him, though.

449
00:04:32,614 --> 00:04:35,154
A-Anyway, boot it up!

450
00:04:36,944 --> 00:04:40,034
We found it thanks to Mayushii.

451
00:04:40,034 --> 00:04:40,704
Yeah.

452
00:04:40,994 --> 00:04:42,784
The glory for this goes to you.

453
00:04:46,124 --> 00:04:46,954
It turned on.

454
00:04:47,244 --> 00:04:50,164
Now you can analyze that program code, right?

